# Keep upload directories in version control
# This file ensures the upload directory structure is maintained

# Directory Structure:
# uploads/
#   ├── images/     - Optimized patient photos, procedure images
#   ├── videos/     - Educational videos, testimonials
#   ├── documents/  - PDFs, forms, educational materials
#   └── temp/       - Temporary files during processing

# Security Notes:
# - All uploads are validated for file type and size
# - Images are automatically optimized using Sharp
# - Files are stored with UUID names to prevent path traversal
# - Directory is served through Express static middleware with security headers